  "issue": {
    "body": "First of all, thank you for excellent framework! I've started used it for one personal project and find it very useful. Also i saw roadmap of framework - it look nice. But there are some things which would be very helpful if they will have integrated with Stralette and unfortunately, i didn't find any mentions about.\r\n\r\nAmong of them is localization and internationalization. Are any plans to do this via Middleware or something else? Let's discuss how it can be implemented...)",
